      "changelog": "Several notes, saved automatically. Copy to clipboard. Post as text layer, into the selected text layer, or as a comp or layer marker. A sketch per note; Sketch to Comp keeps proportions, smooths lines and rounds the ends."
    },
    {
      "id": "bouncer",
